OL,3,GNEWSARoad to remain closed after second
OL,4,Aburst water main
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road is expected to remain closed for
OL,7,Fa further two weeks after a second
OL,8,Fwater main burst.
OL,10,FRepair work was already under way on
OL,11,Fthe A689 at Howden-le-Wear, near the
OL,12,FGulf petrol station, following a major
OL,13,Fburst on 4 November.
OL,15,FNorthumbrian Water said a second main
OL,16,Fhad burst further along the road.
OL,18,FThe company said there was currently no
OL,19,Finterruption to customers' water
OL,20,Fsupplies and that it was providing
OL,21,Fshuttle buses to help people affected
OL,22,Fby the closure.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
